@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = replace-with-cognito-access-token
@courseId = replace
@classId = replace
@liveId = replace

### Perfil — sucesso usa { data, meta }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: local-smoke-1

### Criar curso — mutação acumulativa exige chave
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: course-demo-001

{"name":"Engenharia de Software","code":"ES-2026"}

### Listar com cursor opaco
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/courses?limit=20&cursor={{cursor}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Agendar live
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes/{{classId}}/lives
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: live-demo-001

{"title":"Arquitetura Serverless","scheduledStartAt":"2026-08-01T22:00:00.000Z","scheduledDurationMinutes":200}

### Entrar — deliberadamente sem Idempotency-Key; sempre emite credenciais novas
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lives/{{liveId}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Renovar token IVS — também sem Idempotency-Key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lives/{{liveId}}/token/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ticket WebSocket — também sem Idempotency-Key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lives/{{liveId}}/realtime/ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Encerrar live
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lives/{{liveId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: finish-demo-001
